"Academic Use" means use by a university, college, school, public research institute, or other educational or scholarly organization for teaching, learning, or research.

"Non-Commercial Use" means use by a non-profit organization or by an individual for research, education, evaluation, or internal study where no direct or indirect commercial advantage, commercial service, or revenue-generating product is involved.

"Commercial Use" means any use that is not Academic Use or Non-Commercial Use, including use by or for a for-profit entity, use in a paid product or service, use in commercial consulting, use in contract research for a commercial customer, or use for internal commercial operations that support revenue-generating activity.

